sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Operator
  participant CLI
  participant Git as Authored source
  participant API as Kubernetes API
  participant Gateway as agentgateway
  participant Edge as Retained edge

  Operator->>CLI: discover
  CLI-->>Operator: candidates and required overrides
  Operator->>CLI: deploy plan
  CLI->>Git: read config and manifests
  CLI-->>Operator: deterministic JSON plan and Markdown summary
  Operator->>CLI: deploy apply with expected context and confirmation
  CLI->>API: save pre-change snapshot
  CLI->>API: apply planned resources
  CLI->>Gateway: poll Programmed, Accepted, ResolvedRefs, Attached
  CLI-->>Operator: verification report
  Operator->>CLI: cutover plan
  CLI-->>Operator: edge change and rollback point
  Operator->>CLI: cutover apply
  CLI->>Edge: apply approved edge change
  Operator->>CLI: rollback apply if validation fails
  CLI->>API: restore pre-existing resources and delete only created resources
